      "text": "乘客您好，欢迎您搭乘京港地铁列车，希望您有一个愉快的旅程\nWelcome to Beijing MTR, we hope you’ll have a pleasant journey. \n\n下一站北京南站，乘客可以换乘地铁14号线\n列车运行方向左侧的车门将会开启\nNext station, Beijing South railway station. \nInterchange station with line 14. Doors will open on the left.\n\n为确保安全，携带大件行李的乘客，请使用垂直电梯，不要使用扶手电梯\nFor safety reasons passengers with package and bulky items should use the elevator. \n\n@BI3BXI"
